  <title>Expense products</title>

  <p>Expense products are the extra charges on a vendor's invoice, such as
  freight, fuel surcharge or handling. The <gui>Expense products</gui> button
  of <link xref="unprocessed_po"/> lists them.</p>

  <list>
    <item><p><gui>New</gui> adds one; click its <gui>Product</gui> to name
    it, its <gui>Price</gui> for a usual amount, and choose the
    <gui>Expense account</gui> it posts to.</p></item>
    <item><p><gui>Delete</gui> removes the selected one, or marks it deleted
    if it has already been used.</p></item>
  </list>

</page>
